  "id": "black-bean-and-rice-enchiladas",
  "name": "Black Bean and Rice Enchiladas",
  "subtitle": "Hearty bean-and-rice enchiladas with melted cheddar",
  "description": "Flour tortillas filled with seasoned black beans, vegetables, brown rice, and cheddar, then baked over salsa until hot and bubbling.",
